ain (everything as it should be -> 3. in picture)\n\n### Case 2\n1. Open MRP\n2. Select Node Trigger inside the Scene tree\n3. Hover over header Trigger in Inspector (tooltip empty -> 1. in picture)\n4. Change **player.gd** and save\n5. Hover over header Trigger in Inspector again (nothing changed -> 1. in picture)\n6. Change **trigger.gd** and save\n7. Hover over header Trigger in Inspector again (everything as it should be -> 3. in picture)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bbcode-class-issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19594181/bbcode-class-issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104986/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}